            </div>
            <div class="row"><b>Runtime</b><span>Python 3.14+ · cyclopts · entry-point plugins</span></div>
            <div class="row"><b>Optional</b><span>spaCy (planned)</span></div>
            <div class="row"><b>Output</b><span>text · json (sarif planned)</span></div>
